{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、伊織とみり愛が懐いてきています。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/02/11/4170664/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかちはるさん見てると\n手ふりたくなる！ってみり愛が言ってて\nえ、私もー！って伊織。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私を見つけるとずーっと手を満面の笑みで\n振ってくる2人です☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/02/11/4170664/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/02/11/4170664/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鼻の穴に手つっこむフリだけしてくれたみり愛と、\n本気でつっこもうとしてくる伊織。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"純奈は伊織に本気で突っ込まれたことあるんだって...！\n容赦なさすぎ...！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2人にはついつい塩対応しちゃうけど...\n内心は凄い嬉しいし楽しいです(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仲良し仲良し(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この時沢山写真撮ったので\nまた載せますね〜◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"----------------------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♬ ChihaMusic"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ラストシーン」JUJUさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よく聞きたくなるし\nカラオケで歌いたくなる曲。\nこの切なさと、この大人な雰囲気に\n憧れて昔もよく聞いてたな〜\nJUJUさんの声素敵。\n\"灯りは消したままで 音楽はかけたままで\nここから出ていって 私が窓辺で寝ているうちに\"\nここが好き。\n日常的な場面だからこそ\n離れることの辛さが沁みてくる。\n窓辺でっていうところもいい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/02/11/4170664/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/02/11/4170664/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちらっ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は一日中ずっとお仕事でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一日中って聞くと大変そうだな〜って\n思われるかもしれないですが\n実は凄い楽しかったの☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなでワイワイできたよ〜\n仲良しって素敵だな〜って改めて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ちはる"}],"source":"archive"}